"""Retired historical folder-overlay control (#524 PL-002).

This entrypoint overlaid the implicit-seeding/derived-pointer contract and
omitted dependencies needed by current category validation. It cannot qualify
current source. It never starts or reuses a guest, resets a backend, writes an
owner directory, or treats an argument refusal as a passing negative case.

Current target qualification uses tools/vm-qa and tools/cloud-round-trip with
an owned current image, plus the source-bound cloud-folder cases documented in
docs/pixelelated/cloud-folder-flow-review.md. The host category controls are in
tools/pixelelated-cloud-validator-test; they do not claim VM qualification.

Historical receipts stay unchanged. To reproduce one, use its exact recorded
tool/source checkout; git history retains this entrypoint's original body.
--help exits 0; every attempted run exits 2 before starting any work.
"""
import sys


def main():
    help_only = sys.argv[1:] in (["--help"], ["-h"])
    print(__doc__, file=sys.stdout if help_only else sys.stderr, end="")
    return 0 if help_only else 2


if __name__ == "__main__":
    sys.exit(main())
